            "text": "{\"messages\":[{\"id\":\"1776846020287662046\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>The build succeeded with only warnings (0 errors). The changes are complete.\\n\\nLet me provide a summary of what was changed.\\n</think>\\n\\nDone! I've filled in the empty values for `ShippingModeName`, `BaseRateName`, and `CurrencyName` in the `GetDetailContractCustomerUseCase.cs` file.\\n\\n## Summary of Changes\\n\\nThe code now fetches lookup data from the reference service for:\\n1. **ShippingMode** - via `GetListShippingMode`\\n2. **BaseRate** - via `GetListBaseRate`  \\n3. **Currency** - via `GetListCurrency`\\n\\nAnd then populates the corresponding name fields:\\n- `IncentiveCostModel.ShippingModeName` - looked up from `ShippingMode` by ID\\n- `IncentiveChargeCodeModel.BaseRateName` - looked up from `BaseRate` by ID\\n- `IncentiveChargeCodeModel.CurrencyName` - looked up from `Currency` by ID\\n\\n**Build result:** ✅ **0 errors** (only pre-existing warnings)\",\"timestamp\":\"1776846020287666014\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"\",\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"},{\"id\":\"1776846009796809481\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>/home/ginwa/work/contract-customer/UseCases/FallbackCost/UpdateFallbackCostUseCase.cs(151,70): warning CS8619: Nullability of reference types in value of type 'Task<ResGetVehicleTypeDetailById>' doesn't match target type 'Task<ResGetVehicleTypeDetailById?>'. [/home/ginwa/work/contract-customer/ContractCustomer.csproj]\\n/home/ginwa/work/contract-customer/UseCases/FallbackCost/UpdateFallbackCostUseCase.cs(151,38): warning CS8600: Converting null literal or possible null value to non-nullable type. [/home/ginwa/work/contract-customer/ContractCustomer.csproj]\\n/home/ginwa/work/contract-customer/UseCases/FallbackCost/UpdateFallbackCostUseCase.cs(179,67): warning CS8602: Dereference of a possibly null reference. [/home/ginw