",\"content\":\"<think>Now I understand the issue. Looking at the code:\\n\\n1. For `IncentiveCostModel`:\\n   - `ShippingModeName = string.Empty` - needs to be filled from a ShippingMode lookup\\n   - The model has `ShippingModeId` and `ShippingModeCode` from `ic` object\\n\\n2. For `IncentiveChargeCodeModel`:\\n   - `BaseRateName = string.Empty` - needs to be filled from a BaseRate lookup\\n   - `CurrencyName = string.Empty` - needs to be filled from a Currency lookup\\n\\nThe pattern from routing cost code (lines 341-345) shows how to do this:\\n```csharp\\nBaseRateName = brj?.Name ?? string.Empty,\\nCurrencyName = curj?.Name ?? string.Empty,\\n```\\n\\nTo implement this properly, I need to:\\n1. Collect all ShippingModeIds, BaseRateIds, and CurrencyIds\\n2. Call the respective reference services\\n3. Create lookup dictionaries\\n4. Fill in the values\\n\\nLet me implement this properly:\\n</think>\\n\\nNow I understand the issue. Looking at the code:\\n\\n1. **IncentiveCostModel** (`ShippingModeName = string.Empty` at line 625) - needs ShippingMode name lookup\\n2. **IncentiveChargeCodeModel** (`BaseRateName = string.Empty` at line 648 and `CurrencyName = string.Empty` at line 651) - need BaseRate and Currency name lookups\\n\\nI'll implement the same pattern used for routing costs (lines 341-345). Let me update the code:\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845986707151216\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"text_replace\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845928479137916\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>namespace ContractCustomer.Models;\\n\\npublic class MstContractCustomerIncentiveCostDetail\\n{\\n    public int Id { get; set; }\\n\\n    public long IncentiveCostId { get; set; }\\n\\n    public int ChargeCodeId { get; set; }\\n    public string? ChargeCode { get; set; }\\n    public string? ChargeCodeName { get; set; }\\n\\n    public decimal? Amount { get; set; }\\n\\n    public int? ChargeTransactionTypeId { get; set; }\\n    public string? ChargeTransactionTypeCode { get; set; }\\n    public string? ChargeTransactionTypeName { get; set; }\\n\\n    public int? CurrencyId { get; set; }\\n    public string? CurrencyCode { get; set; }\\n\\n    public int? ChargeTypeId { get; set; }\\n    public string? ChargeTypeName { get; set; }\\n\\n    public int? BaseRateId { get; set; }\\n\\n    public int? RefChargeCodeId { get; set; }\\n    public string? RefChargeCode { get; set; }\\n    public string? RefChargeCodeName { get; set; }\\n\\n    public bool IsBbmFormula { get; set; } = false;\\n    public decimal? FuelConsumptionRatio { get; set; }\\n    public decimal? UnitPrice { get; set; }\\n    public string? Unit { get; set; }\\n\\n    public bool IsCommissionProRata { get; set; } = false;\\n    public int? CommissionStartPercentage { get; set; }\\n\\n    public int? RemainingChargeCodeId { get; set; }\\n    public string? RemainingChargeCode { get; set; }\\n    public string? RemainingChargeCodeName { get; set; }\\n\\n    public bool IsCostReimburse { get; set; } = false;\\n    public int? RevenueReimburseCodeId { get; set; }\\n\\n    public bool IsAdditionalCost { get; set; } = false;\\n    public int? AdditionalRevenueCodeId { get; set; }\\n\\n    public int IsActive { get; set; } = 1;\\n\\n    public DateTime? CreatedAt { get; set; }\\n    public string? CreatedBy { get; set; }\\n\\n    public DateTime? UpdatedAt { get; set; }\\n    public string? UpdatedBy { get; set; }\\n}\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>56</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845928479140410\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845928456132897\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>I see - `MstContractCustomerIncentiveCost` has `ShippingModeId` but there's no `ShippingModeName` in the model. The model only stores the ID and Code, not the Name.\\n\\nSimilarly, looking at the incentive cost details, I need to understand what fields they have. Let me check `MstContractCustomerIncentiveCostDetail`.\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845928456139379\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845920896386345\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>namespace ContractCustomer.Models\\n{\\n    public class MstContractCustomerIncentiveCost\\n    {\\n        public int Id { get; set; }\\n\\n        public string ContractNo { get; set; } = null!;\\n\\n        public int OrderTypeId { get; set; }\\n        public string? OrderTypeCode { get; set; }\\n        public string? OrderTypeName { get; set; }\\n\\n        public int VehicleTypeId { get; set; }\\n        public string? VehicleTypeCode { get; set; }\\n\\n        public int VehicleTypeDetailId { get; set; }\\n        public string? VehicleTypeDetailName { get; set; }\\n\\n        public int? ShippingModeId { get; set; }\\n        public string? ShippingModeCode { get; set; }\\n\\n        public bool IsTrailer { get; set; } = false;\\n        public int? TrailerTypeId { get; set; }\\n        public string? TrailerTypeName { get; set; }\\n\\n        public int? EquipmentId { get; set; }\\n        public string? EquipmentName { get; set; }\\n\\n        public bool IsActive { get; set; } = true;\\n\\n        public DateTime CreatedAt { get; set; }\\n        public string? CreatedBy { get; set; }\\n\\n        public DateTime? UpdatedAt { get; set; }\\n        public string? UpdatedBy { get; set; }\\n    }\\n}\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>37</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845920896388459\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845920872174367\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>Let me check the MstContractCustomerIncentiveCost model to see if it has ShippingMode data that we can use.\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845920872185789\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845915165324992\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>Models/MstContractCustomerIncentiveCostDetail.cs:3:public class MstContractCustomerIncentiveCostDetail\\nModels/MstContractCustomerIncentiveCost.cs:3:    public class MstContractCustomerIncentiveCost\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>2</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845915165327136\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845915134624249\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>Now I understand the issue. Looking at lines 625, 648, and 651:\\n\\n1. Line 625: `ShippingModeName = string.Empty` - should be populated from ShippingMode data\\n2. Line 648: `BaseRateName = string.Empty` - should be populated from BaseRate data  \\n3. Line 651: `CurrencyName = string.Empty` - should be populated from Currency data\\n\\nThe Incentive Cost section doesn't fetch the reference data for these fields, unlike the Routing Cost section which fetches ShippingMode, BaseRate, and Currency data.\\n\\nTo fill these values, I need to:\\n1. Get unique ShippingModeIds, BaseRateIds, CurrencyIds from incentive costs and their details\\n2. Fetch the reference data\\n3. Join with the data to get names\\n\\nLet me look at the data models to understand the structure better.\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845915134629619\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845902342638327\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<path>/home/ginwa/work/contract-customer/UseCases/ContractCustomer/GetDetailContractCustomerUseCase.cs</path>\\n<content> 606\\t\\n 607\\t\\n 608\\t                // Incentive Costs\\n 609\\t                var incentiveCosts = await _incentiveCostRepository.Db().GetByContractNo(request.ContractNo);\\n 610\\t                var incentiveCostIds = incentiveCosts.Select(x => (int)x.Id).ToArray();\\n 611\\t                var incentiveCostDetails = await _incentiveCostDetailRepository.Db().GetByIncentiveCostIds(incentiveCostIds);\\n 612\\t\\n 613\\t                var incentiveDetailLookup = incentiveCostDetails\\n 614\\t                    .GroupBy(x => x.IncentiveCostId)\\n 615\\t                    .ToDictionary(g => g.Key, g => g);\\n 616\\t\\n 617\\t                var resIncentiveCosts = new RepeatedField<IncentiveCostModel>();\\n 618\\t\\n 619\\t                foreach (var ic in incentiveCosts)\\n 620\\t                {\\n 621\\t                    var incentiveModel = new IncentiveCostModel\\n 622\\t                    {\\n 623\\t                        ShippingModeId = ic.ShippingModeId.GetValueOrDefault(),\\n 624\\t                        ShippingModeCode = ic.ShippingModeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n 625\\t                        ShippingModeName = string.Empty,\\n 626\\t                        VehicleTypeId = ic.VehicleTypeId,\\n 627\\t                        VehicleTypeCode = ic.VehicleTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n 628\\t                        VehicleTypeDetailId = ic.VehicleTypeDetailId,\\n 629\\t                        VehicleTypeDetailName = ic.VehicleTypeDetailName ?? string.Empty,\\n 630\\t                        IsTrailer = ic.IsTrailer,\\n 631\\t                        TrailerTypeId = ic.TrailerTypeId ?? 0,\\n 632\\t                        TrailerTypeName = ic.TrailerTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n 633\\t                        EquipmentId = ic.EquipmentId ?? 0,\\n 634\\t                        EquipmentName = ic.EquipmentName ?? string.Empty,\\n 635\\t                    };\\n 636\\t\\n 637\\t                    if (incentiveDetailLookup.TryGetValue(ic.Id, out var details))\\n 638\\t                    {\\n 639\\t                        foreach (var d in details)\\n 640\\t                        {\\n 641\\t                            incentiveModel.ListChargeCode.Add(new IncentiveChargeCodeModel\\n 642\\t                            {\\n 643\\t                                ChargeCodeId = d.ChargeCodeId,\\n 644\\t                                ChargeCode = d.ChargeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n 645\\t                                ChargeCodeName = d.ChargeCodeName ?? string.Empty,\\n 646\\t                                Amount = (double?)d.Amount ?? 0,\\n 647\\t                                BaseRateId = d.BaseRateId ?? 0,\\n 648\\t                                BaseRateName = string.Empty,\\n 649\\t                                CurrencyId = d.CurrencyId ?? 0,\\n 650\\t                                CurrencyCode = d.CurrencyCode ?? string.Empty,\\n 651\\t                                CurrencyName = string.Empty,\\n 652\\t                                ChargeTransactionTypeId = d.ChargeTransactionTypeId ?? 0,\\n 653\\t                                ChargeTransactionTypeCode = d.ChargeTransactionTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n 654\\t                                ChargeTransactionTypeName = d.ChargeTransactionTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n 655\\t                                RefChargeCodeId = d.RefChargeCodeId ?? 0,\\n 656\\t                                RefChargeCodeCode = d.RefChargeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n 657\\t                                RefChargeCodeName = d.RefChargeCodeName ?? string.Empty,\\n 658\\t                                ChargeTypeId = d.ChargeTypeId ?? 0,\\n 659\\t                                ChargeTypeName = d.ChargeTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n 660\\t                            });\\n 661\\t                        }\\n 662\\t                    }\\n 663\\t                    resIncentiveCosts.Add(incentiveModel);\\n 664\\t                }\\n 665\\t\\n 666\\t                response.IncentiveCosts.AddRange(resIncentiveCosts);\\n 667\\t\\n 668\\t\\n 669\\t                return response;\\n 670\\t            }\\n 671\\t            catch (Exception ex)\\n 672\\t            {\\n 673\\t                throw;\\n 674\\t            }\\n 675\\t        }\\n 676\\t    }\\n 677\\t}\\n</content>\\n<total_lines>677</total_lines>\\n<start_line>605</start_line>\\n<end_line>676</end_line>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845902342640281\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"read_file\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845902324890258\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>Now I understand the code structure. The code already fetches shipping modes, base rates, and currencies but only uses them for routing costs (lines 276-297). The incentive costs section (lines 610-660) doesn't use this data.\\n\\nI need to modify the code to also fetch shipping modes, base rates, and currencies for incentive costs. The changes needed are:\\n\\n1. Collect `ic.ShippingModeId` values from incentive costs\\n2. Collect `d.BaseRateId` and `d.CurrencyId` values from incentive cost details\\n3. Fetch this data using `_referenceGrpcService`\\n4. Use the fetched data to populate `ShippingModeName`, `BaseRateName`, and `CurrencyName`\\n\\nLet me create the solution. The code already has the pattern at lines 276-343 - I just need to replicate it for incentive costs.\\n</think>\\n\\nNow I understand the code. The routing cost section already uses `shippingModeData`, `baseRateData`, and `currencyData` (lines 276-345), but the incentive cost section doesn't. I need to add similar lookups for incentive costs.\\n\\nLet me read the exact section where I need to make changes:\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845902324897903\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"read_file\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845887310068167\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>                var incentiveCostIds = incentiveCosts.Select(x => (int)x.Id).ToArray();\\n                var incentiveCostDetails = await _incentiveCostDetailRepository.Db().GetByIncentiveCostIds(incentiveCostIds);\\n\\n                var incentiveDetailLookup = incentiveCostDetails\\n                    .GroupBy(x => x.IncentiveCostId)\\n                    .ToDictionary(g => g.Key, g => g);\\n\\n                var resIncentiveCosts = new RepeatedField<IncentiveCostModel>();\\n\\n                foreach (var ic in incentiveCosts)\\n                {\\n                    var incentiveModel = new IncentiveCostModel\\n                    {\\n                        ShippingModeId = ic.ShippingModeId.GetValueOrDefault(),\\n                        ShippingModeCode = ic.ShippingModeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                        ShippingModeName = string.Empty,\\n                        VehicleTypeId = ic.VehicleTypeId,\\n                        VehicleTypeCode = ic.VehicleTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                        VehicleTypeDetailId = ic.VehicleTypeDetailId,\\n                        VehicleTypeDetailName = ic.VehicleTypeDetailName ?? string.Empty,\\n                        IsTrailer = ic.IsTrailer,\\n                        TrailerTypeId = ic.TrailerTypeId ?? 0,\\n                        TrailerTypeName = ic.TrailerTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                        EquipmentId = ic.EquipmentId ?? 0,\\n                        EquipmentName = ic.EquipmentName ?? string.Empty,\\n                    };\\n\\n                    if (incentiveDetailLookup.TryGetValue(ic.Id, out var details))\\n                    {\\n                        foreach (var d in details)\\n                        {\\n                            incentiveModel.ListChargeCode.Add(new IncentiveChargeCodeModel\\n                            {\\n                                ChargeCodeId = d.ChargeCodeId,\\n                                ChargeCode = d.ChargeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                ChargeCodeName = d.ChargeCodeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                Amount = (double?)d.Amount ?? 0,\\n                                BaseRateId = d.BaseRateId ?? 0,\\n                                BaseRateName = string.Empty,\\n                                CurrencyId = d.CurrencyId ?? 0,\\n                                CurrencyCode = d.CurrencyCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                CurrencyName = string.Empty,\\n                                ChargeTransactionTypeId = d.ChargeTransactionTypeId ?? 0,\\n                                ChargeTransactionTypeCode = d.ChargeTransactionTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                ChargeTransactionTypeName = d.ChargeTransactionTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                RefChargeCodeId = d.RefChargeCodeId ?? 0,\\n                                RefChargeCodeCode = d.RefChargeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                RefChargeCodeName = d.RefChargeCodeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                ChargeTypeId = d.ChargeTypeId ?? 0,\\n                                ChargeTypeName = d.ChargeTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                            });\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>51</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845887310070451\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845887292169906\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>Looking at the pattern in routing cost section (lines 284-297), they use `shippingModeData` which is populated from `_referenceGrpcService.GetListShippingMode`. This same data is used to join and get ShippingModeName.\\n\\nFor Incentive Cost, there is no such lookup happening. We need to:\\n1. Get the ShippingMode IDs from the incentive costs\\n2. Call GetListShippingMode\\n3. Join to get the ShippingModeName\\n\\nSimilarly for the IncentiveChargeCodeModel, we need:\\n- BaseRateName → need to look up base rates\\n- CurrencyName → need to look up currencies\\n\\nNow I understand the task. I need to add the lookups for:\\n1. ShippingModeName\\n2. BaseRateName \\n3. CurrencyName\\n\\nThe challenge is that for IncentiveChargeCodeModel, the BaseRate and Currency details are in the `incentiveDetailLookup`. We need to extract the BaseRate and Currency IDs from the details, look them up, and then join them.\\n\\nLet me write the solution:\\n</think>\\n\\nNow I understand the pattern. Let me look at the exact code sections that need to be filled:\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845887292176940\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845870754030211\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>        Task<ResGetListShippingMode> GetListShippingMode(ReqGetListShippingMode request, UserInfo userInfo);\\n        Task<resVehicleTypeAllData> GetListVehicleType(reqVehicleTypeAll request, UserInfo userInfo);\\n        Task<VehicleTypeModel?> GetVehicleTypeById(reqVehicleTypeId request, UserInfo userInfo);\\n        Task<resChargeCodeAll> GetListChargeCode(reqChargeCodePagination request, UserInfo userInfo);\\n        Task<resBaseRateListData> GetListBaseRate(reqBaseRateList request, UserInfo userInfo);\\n        Task<resCurrencyAll> GetListCurrency(reqCurrencyPagination request, UserInfo userInfo);\\n--\\n        public async Task<ResGetListShippingMode> GetListShippingMode(ReqGetListShippingMode request, UserInfo userInfo)\\n        {\\n            try\\n            {\\n                Metadata metadata = new Metadata();\\n                metadata.Add(\\\"User-Info\\\", JsonConvert.SerializeObject(userInfo));\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>13</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845870754032956\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845870722894213\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>I see that `_referenceGrpcService` is available. Now I need to understand:\\n\\n1. How to get ShippingMode name for incentive costs\\n2. How to get BaseRate and Currency names for incentive cost details\\n\\nLooking at lines 279-297, I can see that for routing costs, they:\\n1. Get shipping mode IDs as comma-separated string\\n2. Call `_referenceGrpcService.GetListShippingMode(new ReqGetListShippingMode { Id = shippingModeIds }, userInfo)`\\n3. Join with the result\\n\\nFor incentive costs, they don't seem to call any gRPC service to get the shipping mode name. The same applies to base rate and currency names.\\n\\nLet me look for how incentive costs are processed to understand what data is already available:\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845870722900826\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845856995574537\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>using ContractCustomer.Protos;\\nusing ContractCustomer.Repositories;\\nusing ContractCustomer.Repositories.Grpc;\\nusing ContractCustomer.Utils;\\nusing Google.Protobuf.Collections;\\nusing Grpc.Core;\\nusing Microsoft.AspNetCore.Routing;\\nusing Microsoft.IdentityModel.Tokens;\\nusing ReferenceService.Protos;\\n\\nnamespace ContractCustomer.UseCases\\n{\\n    public interface IGetDetailContractCustomerUseCase\\n    {\\n        Task<ResGetDetailContractCustomer> GetDetailContractCustomer(ReqGetDetailContractCustomer request, ServerCallContext context);\\n    }\\n\\n    public class GetDetailContractCustomerUseCase : IGetDetailContractCustomerUseCase\\n    {\\n        private readonly IReferenceGrpcService _referenceGrpcService;\\n        private readonly IContractCustomerRepository _contractCustomerRepo;\\n        private readonly IContractCustomerDetailRepository _contractCustomerDetailRepo;\\n        private readonly IContractCustomerVehicleRepository _contractCustomerVehicleRepo;\\n        private readonly IContractCustomerRoutingRepository _contractCustomerRoutingRepo;\\n        private readonly IContractCustomerRoutingCostRepository _contractCustomerRoutingCostRepo;\\n        private readonly IContractCustomerRoutingCostDetailRepository _contractCustomerRoutingCostDetailRepo;\\n        private readonly IContractModelRepository _contractModelRepo;\\n        private readonly IChangeTypeRepository _changeTypeRepo;\\n        private readonly IContractCustomerRoutingDocumentRepository _contractCustomerRoutingDocumentRepository;\\n        private readonly IMstContractCustomerFallbackCostingRepository _contractCustomerFallbackCostRepository;\\n        private readonly IMstContractCustomerFallbackCostDetailRepository _contractCustomerFallbackCostDetailRepository;\\n        private readonly IMstContractCustomerIncentiveCostRepository _incentiveCostRepository;\\n        private readonly IMstContractCustomerIncentiveCostDetailRepository _incentiveCostDetailRepository;\\n\\n        public GetDetailContractCustomerUseCase(\\n            IReferenceGrpcService referenceGrpcService,\\n            IContractCustomerRepository contractCustomerRepository,\\n            IContractCustomerDetailRepository contractCustomerDetailRepository,\\n            IContractCustomerVehicleRepository contractCustomerVehicleRepository,\\n            IContractCustomerRoutingRepository contractCustomerRoutingRepository,\\n            IContractCustomerRoutingCostRepository contractCustomerRoutingCostRepository,\\n            IContractCustomerRoutingCostDetailRepository contractCustomerRoutingCostDetailRepository,\\n            IContractModelRepository contractModelRepository,\\n            IChangeTypeRepository changeTypeRepository,\\n            IContractCustomerRoutingDocumentRepository contractCustomerRoutingDocumentRepository,\\n            IMstContractCustomerFallbackCostingRepository contractCustomerFallbackCostingRepository,\\n            IMstContractCustomerFallbackCostDetailRepository contractCustomerFallbackCostDetailRepository,\\n            IMstContractCustomerIncentiveCostRepository incentiveCostRepository,\\n            IMstContractCustomerIncentiveCostDetailRepository incentiveCostDetailRepository\\n        )\\n        {\\n            _referenceGrpcService = referenceGrpcService ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(referenceGrpcService));\\n            _contractCustomerRepo = contractCustomerRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerRepository));\\n            _contractCustomerDetailRepo = contractCustomerDetailRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerDetailRepository));\\n            _contractCustomerVehicleRepo = contractCustomerVehicleRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerVehicleRepository));\\n            _contractCustomerRoutingRepo = contractCustomerRoutingRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerRoutingRepository));\\n            _contractCustomerRoutingCostRepo = contractCustomerRoutingCostRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerRoutingCostRepository));\\n            _contractCustomerRoutingCostDetailRepo = contractCustomerRoutingCostDetailRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerRoutingCostDetailRepository));\\n            _contractModelRepo = contractModelRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractModelRepository));\\n            _changeTypeRepo = changeTypeRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(changeTypeRepository));\\n            _contractCustomerRoutingDocumentRepository = contractCustomerRoutingDocumentRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerRoutingDocumentRepository));\\n            _contractCustomerFallbackCostRepository = contractCustomerFallbackCostingRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerFallbackCostingRepository));\\n            _contractCustomerFallbackCostDetailRepository = contractCustomerFallbackCostDetailRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(contractCustomerFallbackCostDetailRepository));\\n            _incentiveCostRepository = incentiveCostRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(incentiveCostRepository));\\n            _incentiveCostDetailRepository = incentiveCostDetailRepository ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(incentiveCostDetailRepository));\\n        }\\n\\n        public async Task<ResGetDetailContractCustomer> GetDetailContractCustomer(ReqGetDetailContractCustomer request, ServerCallContext context)\\n        {\\n            try\\n            {\\n                var dt = DateTime.UtcNow.AddHours(7);\\n                var userInfo = Helper.GetUserInfo(context);\\n                if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(userInfo.ClientId))\\n                    throw new RpcException(new Grpc.Core.Status(StatusCode.NotFound, \\\"User tidak memiliki client id\\\"));\\n\\n                if (request.ContractNo.IsNullOrEmpty())\\n                    throw new RpcException(new Status(StatusCode.InvalidArgument, \\\"Invalid contract_no\\\"));\\n\\n                var cCustomerData = await _contractCustomerRepo.db().GetByContractNo(request.ContractNo);\\n                if (cCustomerData == null)\\n                    throw new RpcException(new Status(StatusCode.NotFound, \\\"Data contract customer tidak ditemukan, coba lagi!\\\"));\\n\\n                ResGetDetailContractCustomer response = new ResGetDetailContractCustomer();\\n                var contractModel = await _contractModelRepo.db().GetById(cCustomerData.ContractModelId);\\n                var changeTypeData = await _changeTypeRepo.db().GetById(cCustomerData.ChangeTypeId);\\n                var customerList = await _referenceGrpcService.GetListCustomer(new ReqPagingCustomer { Code = cCustomerData.CustomerCode }, userInfo);\\n\\n                //header\\n                var customer = customerList.ListCustomer.FirstOrDefault();\\n\\n                response.Id = cCustomerData.Id;\\n                response.ContractNo = cCustomerData.ContractNo ?? string.Empty;\\n                response.CustomerCode = cCustomerData.CustomerCode ?? string.Empty;\\n                response.CustomerName = cCustomerData.CustomerName ?? string.Empty;\\n                response.StartDate = cCustomerData.StartDate?.ToString(\\\"yyyy-MM-dd\\\") ?? string.Empty;\\n                response.EndDate = cCustomerData.EndDate?.ToString(\\\"yyyy-MM-dd\\\") ?? string.Empty;\\n                response.BillingPlanType = cCustomerData.BillingPlanType ?? string.Empty;\\n                response.ReferenceDocument = cCustomerData.ReferenceDocument ?? string.Empty;\\n                response.ContractModelId = cCustomerData.ContractModelId;\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>100</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845856995578204\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845856973255082\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>Now I understand better. The proto uses wrapper types like `google.protobuf.StringValue`. The C# code doesn't directly use `StringValue.Empty` - it needs to use `string.Empty` but the actual value should come from the reference data.\\n\\nNow I need to understand what needs to be done:\\n\\n1. For **ShippingModeName** (line 625): We need to fetch the ShippingMode data and use the name from there. Looking at lines 276-297, we can see that there's a `GetListShippingMode` call. We need to do the same for incentive costs.\\n\\n2. For **BaseRateName** (line 648): We need to look up the base rate name using the `baseRateData` lookup table.\\n\\n3. For **CurrencyName** (line 651): We need to look up the currency name using the `currencyData` lookup table.\\n\\nLet me look more closely at the code to understand how to populate these values. Let me check if there's a shipping mode lookup already happening that could be reused.\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845856973263127\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845845018442109\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>message IncentiveCostModel {\\n  google.protobuf.Int32Value shipping_mode_id = 4 [json_name = \\\"shipping_mode_id\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.StringValue shipping_mode_name = 5 [json_name = \\\"shipping_mode_name\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.Int32Value vehicle_type_id = 6 [json_name = \\\"vehicle_type_id\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.StringValue vehicle_type_code = 7 [json_name = \\\"vehicle_type_code\\\"];\\n  repeated IncentiveChargeCodeModel list_charge_code = 10 [json_name = \\\"list_charge_code\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.StringValue shipping_mode_code = 11 [json_name = \\\"shipping_mode_code\\\"];\\n  bool is_trailer = 14 [json_name=\\\"is_trailer\\\"];\\n  int32 vehicle_type_detail_id = 15 [json_name=\\\"vehicle_type_detail_id\\\"];\\n  string vehicle_type_detail_name = 16 [json_name=\\\"vehicle_type_detail_name\\\"];\\n  int32 trailer_type_id = 17 [json_name=\\\"trailer_type_id\\\"];\\n  string trailer_type_name = 18 [json_name=\\\"trailer_type_name\\\"];\\n  int32 equipment_id = 19 [json_name=\\\"equipment_id\\\"];\\n  string equipment_name = 20 [json_name=\\\"equipment_name\\\"];\\n}\\n\\nmessage IncentiveChargeCodeModel {\\n  google.protobuf.Int32Value charge_code_id = 2 [json_name = \\\"charge_code_id\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.StringValue charge_code = 3 [json_name = \\\"charge_code\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.StringValue charge_code_name = 4 [json_name = \\\"charge_code_name\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.Int32Value base_rate_id = 5 [json_name = \\\"base_rate_id\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.StringValue base_rate_name = 6 [json_name = \\\"base_rate_name\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.Int32Value currency_id = 7 [json_name = \\\"currency_id\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.StringValue currency_name = 8 [json_name = \\\"currency_name\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.DoubleValue amount = 9 [json_name = \\\"amount\\\"];\\n  google.protobuf.StringValue currency_code = 10 [json_name = \\\"currency_code\\\"];\\n  int32 charge_transaction_type_id = 11 [json_name=\\\"charge_transaction_type_id\\\"];\\n  string charge_transaction_type_code = 12 [json_name=\\\"charge_transaction_type_code\\\"];\\n  string charge_transaction_type_name = 13 [json_name=\\\"charge_transaction_type_name\\\"];\\n  int32 ref_charge_code_id = 14 [json_name=\\\"ref_charge_code_id\\\"];\\n  string ref_charge_code_code = 15 [json_name=\\\"ref_charge_code_code\\\"];\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>31</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845845018444413\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845844992210220\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>Let me check the proto file to see the IncentiveCostModel definition.\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845844992220920\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845836326617946\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>./Protos/ContractCustomer.proto\\n./UseCases/ContractCustomer/GetDetailContractCustomerUseCase.cs\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>2</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845836326619800\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845836293552117\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>Let me search for the IncentiveCostModel in a different way:\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845836293558448\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845825045386286\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>No output produced.</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>0</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845825045389091\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845825014137437\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>I found it! Look at line 415:\\n`BaseRateName = c.BaseRateName ?? string.Empty,`\\nAnd line 417:\\n`CurrencyName = c.CurrencyName ?? string.Empty,`\\n\\nThe BaseRateName and CurrencyName at lines 415-417 are already using `?? string.Empty`. They're the same fields but in the `ChargeCodeMod` class for the ListChargeCode property inside CostModel.\\n\\nNow let me look for the ones that need fixing - the ones at lines 625, 648, 651. Let me check where those are in context to understand what reference data is available there.\\n\\nActually, let me check the structure of the IncentiveCostModel and FallbackCostModel classes to understand the structure better.\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845825014144039\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845807634557640\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>                                                        ChargeTypeName = crd?.ChargeTypeName\\n                                                    }).ToList();\\n\\n                            var costChargedCodeJoined = (from rc in routingCostJoined\\n                                                         join c in (joinedChargeCode ?? Enumerable.Empty<dynamic>())\\n                                                             on rc.ContractCustomerRoutingCostId equals c.ContractCustomerRoutingCostId into rcGroup\\n                                                         from g in rcGroup.DefaultIfEmpty()\\n                                                         group g by new\\n                                                         {\\n                                                             rc.ContractCustomerRoutingCostId,\\n                                                             rc.ContractCustomerRoutingId,\\n                                                             rc.RoutingName,\\n                                                             rc.ShippingModeId,\\n                                                             rc.ShippingModeCode,\\n                                                             rc.ShippingModeName,\\n                                                             rc.VehicleTypeId,\\n                                                             rc.VehicleTypeCode,\\n                                                             rc.ChargeServiceTypeId,\\n                                                             rc.ChargeServiceTypeName,\\n                                                             rc.RouteId,\\n                                                             rc.IsTrailer,\\n                                                             rc.VehicleTypeDetailId,\\n                                                             rc.VehicleTypeDetailName,\\n                                                             rc.TrailerTypeId,\\n                                                             rc.TrailerTypeName,\\n                                                             rc.EquipmentId,\\n                                                             rc.EquipmentName,\\n                                                             rc.RouteName\\n                                                         }\\n                                    into costGroup\\n                                                         select new\\n                                                         {\\n                                                             ContractCustomerRoutingCostId = costGroup.Key.ContractCustomerRoutingCostId,\\n                                                             ContractCustomerRoutingId = costGroup.Key.ContractCustomerRoutingId,\\n                                                             RoutingName = costGroup.Key.RoutingName,\\n                                                             ShippingModeId = costGroup.Key.ShippingModeId,\\n                                                             ShippingModeCode = costGroup.Key.ShippingModeCode,\\n                                                             ShippingModeName = costGroup.Key.ShippingModeName,\\n                                                             VehicleTypeId = costGroup.Key.VehicleTypeId,\\n                                                             VehicleTypeCode = costGroup.Key.VehicleTypeCode,\\n                                                             ChargeServiceTypeId = costGroup.Key.ChargeServiceTypeId,\\n                                                             ChargeServiceTypeName = costGroup.Key.ChargeServiceTypeName,\\n                                                             RouteId = costGroup.Key.RouteId,\\n                                                             IsTrailer = costGroup.Key.IsTrailer,\\n                                                             VehicleTypeDetailId = costGroup.Key.VehicleTypeDetailId,\\n                                                             VehicleTypeDetailName = costGroup.Key.VehicleTypeDetailName,\\n                                                             TrailerTypeId = costGroup.Key.TrailerTypeId,\\n                                                             TrailerTypeName = costGroup.Key.TrailerTypeName,\\n                                                             EquipmentId = costGroup.Key.EquipmentId,\\n                                                             EquipmentName = costGroup.Key.EquipmentName,\\n                                                             RouteName = costGroup.Key.RouteName,\\n                                                             ListChargeCode = costGroup\\n                                                                 .Where(c => c != null)\\n                                                                 .Select(c => new ChargeCodeMod\\n                                                                 {\\n                                                                     ContractCustomerRoutingCostDetailId = c.ContractCustomerRoutingCostDetailId ?? 0,\\n                                                                     ChargeCodeId = c.ChargeCodeId ?? 0,\\n                                                                     ChargeCode = c.ChargeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     ChargeCodeName = c.ChargeCodeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     BaseRateId = c.BaseRateId ?? 0,\\n                                                                     BaseRateName = c.BaseRateName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     CurrencyId = c.CurrencyId ?? 0,\\n                                                                     CurrencyName = c.CurrencyName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     Amount = c.Amount ?? 0,\\n                                                                     CurrencyCode = c.CurrencyCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     ChargeTransactionTypeId = c.ChargeTransactionTypeId ?? 0,\\n                                                                     ChargeTransactionTypeCode = c.ChargeTransactionTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     ChargeTransactionTypeName = c.ChargeTransactionTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     RefChargeCodeId = c.RefChargeCodeId ?? 0,\\n                                                                     RefChargeCodeCode = c.RefChargeCodeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     RefChargeCodeName = c.RefChargeCodeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                     ChargeTypeId = c.ChargeTypeId ?? 0,\\n                                                                     ChargeTypeName = c.ChargeTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                                                 }).ToList()\\n                                                         }\\n                                ).ToList();\\n\\n                            foreach (var cost in costChargedCodeJoined)\\n                            {\\n                                CostModel model = new CostModel\\n                                {\\n                                    ContractCustomerRoutingCostId = cost.ContractCustomerRoutingCostId ?? 0,\\n                                    ContractCustomerRoutingId = cost.ContractCustomerRoutingId ?? 0,\\n                                    RoutingName = cost.RoutingName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                    ShippingModeId = cost.ShippingModeId ?? 0,\\n                                    ShippingModeName = cost.ShippingModeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                    VehicleTypeId = cost.VehicleTypeId ?? 0,\\n                                    VehicleTypeCode = cost.VehicleTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                    ChargeServiceTypeId = cost.ChargeServiceTypeId ?? 0,\\n                                    ChargeServiceTypeName = cost.ChargeServiceTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                    ShippingModeCode = cost.ShippingModeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                    RouteId = cost.RouteId,\\n                                    VehicleTypeDetailId = cost.VehicleTypeDetailId,\\n                                    VehicleTypeDetailName = cost.VehicleTypeDetailName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                    IsTrailer = cost.IsTrailer,\\n                                    TrailerTypeId = cost.TrailerTypeId,\\n                                    TrailerTypeName = cost.TrailerTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                    EquipmentId = cost.EquipmentId,\\n                                    EquipmentName = cost.EquipmentName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                    RouteName = cost.RouteName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                };\\n\\n                                model.ListChargeCode.AddRange(cost.ListChargeCode);\\n                                costModels.Add(model);\\n                            }\\n                        }\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>106</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845807634560446\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845807614059504\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>I need to understand the context better. Let me look at the whole incentive cost section and see where the ShippingModeName, BaseRateName, and CurrencyName should come from. I should look at the repository that fetches the incentive costs to see if there's a ShippingModeName available from there.\\n</think>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845807614066507\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845796992610553\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>                response.FallbackCosts.AddRange(resFallbackCosts);\\n\\n\\n                // Incentive Costs\\n                var incentiveCosts = await _incentiveCostRepository.Db().GetByContractNo(request.ContractNo);\\n                var incentiveCostIds = incentiveCosts.Select(x => (int)x.Id).ToArray();\\n                var incentiveCostDetails = await _incentiveCostDetailRepository.Db().GetByIncentiveCostIds(incentiveCostIds);\\n\\n                var incentiveDetailLookup = incentiveCostDetails\\n                    .GroupBy(x => x.IncentiveCostId)\\n                    .ToDictionary(g => g.Key, g => g);\\n\\n                var resIncentiveCosts = new RepeatedField<IncentiveCostModel>();\\n\\n                foreach (var ic in incentiveCosts)\\n                {\\n                    var incentiveModel = new IncentiveCostModel\\n                    {\\n                        ShippingModeId = ic.ShippingModeId.GetValueOrDefault(),\\n                        ShippingModeCode = ic.ShippingModeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                        ShippingModeName = string.Empty,\\n                        VehicleTypeId = ic.VehicleTypeId,\\n                        VehicleTypeCode = ic.VehicleTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                        VehicleTypeDetailId = ic.VehicleTypeDetailId,\\n                        VehicleTypeDetailName = ic.VehicleTypeDetailName ?? string.Empty,\\n                        IsTrailer = ic.IsTrailer,\\n                        TrailerTypeId = ic.TrailerTypeId ?? 0,\\n                        TrailerTypeName = ic.TrailerTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                        EquipmentId = ic.EquipmentId ?? 0,\\n                        EquipmentName = ic.EquipmentName ?? string.Empty,\\n                    };\\n\\n                    if (incentiveDetailLookup.TryGetValue(ic.Id, out var details))\\n                    {\\n                        foreach (var d in details)\\n                        {\\n                            incentiveModel.ListChargeCode.Add(new IncentiveChargeCodeModel\\n                            {\\n                                ChargeCodeId = d.ChargeCodeId,\\n                                ChargeCode = d.ChargeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                ChargeCodeName = d.ChargeCodeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                Amount = (double?)d.Amount ?? 0,\\n                                BaseRateId = d.BaseRateId ?? 0,\\n                                BaseRateName = string.Empty,\\n                                CurrencyId = d.CurrencyId ?? 0,\\n                                CurrencyCode = d.CurrencyCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                CurrencyName = string.Empty,\\n                                ChargeTransactionTypeId = d.ChargeTransactionTypeId ?? 0,\\n                                ChargeTransactionTypeCode = d.ChargeTransactionTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                ChargeTransactionTypeName = d.ChargeTransactionTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                RefChargeCodeId = d.RefChargeCodeId ?? 0,\\n                                RefChargeCodeCode = d.RefChargeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                                RefChargeCodeName = d.RefChargeCodeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                                ChargeTypeId = d.ChargeTypeId ?? 0,\\n                                ChargeTypeName = d.ChargeTypeName ?? string.Empty,\\n                            });\\n</stdout>\\n<stderr>No errors.</stderr>\\n<exit_code>0</exit_code>\\n<truncated>false</truncated>\\n<timeout>false</timeout>\\n<stdout_lines>56</stdout_lines>\\n<stderr_lines>0</stderr_lines>\\n<is_self>false</is_self>\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845796992613588\",\n\"is_input\":\"0\",\"is_output\":\"1\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool\"},{\"id\":\"1776845796969635500\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"<think>Now I understand the context. The code already has a pattern where it fetches reference data (like `shippingModeData`, `vehicleTypeData`, etc.) and then joins them to fill in the names.\\n\\nFor the **Incentive Costs** section (lines 625, 648, 651), the `ShippingModeName`, `BaseRateName`, and `CurrencyName` are currently set to `string.Empty` because the code doesn't fetch the shipping mode name.\\n\\nLooking at the pattern used elsewhere (like around line 279-297), I need to:\\n1. Fetch the ShippingMode data for IncentiveCosts\\n2. Get BaseRate data for the charge codes\\n3. Get Currency data for the charge codes\\n\\nHowever, the challenge is that Incentive Costs are processed in a separate section (starting around line 605) and the data has already been fetched for other purposes (Fallback Costs).\\n\\nLooking at the code structure, I need to:\\n1. For `ShippingModeName` at line 625: The code needs to fetch shipping mode data for incentive costs. But there's no shipping mode data fetched for incentive costs specifically.\\n\\nLet me look more closely at how the IncentiveCosts are processed and see what data is available.\\n\\nActually, looking at the code structure more carefully, I see that:\\n- For Fallback Costs, there's no ShippingModeName fetched either (lines 576-577 only have ShippingModeId and ShippingModeCode, no ShippingModeName)\\n- For Incentive Costs, the same pattern exists\\n\\nSo the user wants me to fill these values. Let me see what data is available and understand what changes need to be made.\\n\\nLet me look at how the data is structured and what changes are needed.\\n</think>\\n\\nLet me see more context around line 625 where the values need to be filled:\",\"timestamp\":\"1776845796969641321\",\n\"is_input\":\"1\",\"is_output\":\"0\",\"tool_name\":\"bash\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},{\"id\":\"1776845776500829675\",\"session_id\":\"session_1776845557\",\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"<stdout>                        var AddInfoCharge = new AdditionalCharge()\\n                        {\\n                            MaterialNumber = item.MaterialNumber ?? string.Empty,\\n                            ConditionType = item.ConditionType ?? string.Empty,\\n                            IsTailer = item.IsTrailer,\\n                            VehicleTypeId = item.VehicleTypeId ?? 0,\\n                            VehicleTypeCode = item.VehicleTypeCode ?? string.Empty,\\n                            VehicleTypeDetailId = item.VehicleTypeDetailId ?? 0,\\n                            VehicleTypeDetailName = item.VehicleTypeDetailName ?? string.Empty,\\n                            ExtraCharge = Convert.ToInt32(item.ExtraCharge),\\n                            Tax = Convert.ToInt32(item.Tax),\\n                            TrailerTypeId = item.T